{"channelId":"UCnFa87EMSmu3FwTWf_urLig","row":["Nemours",32000,"At Nemours Children’s Health, our mission is to go well beyond medicine to help children where they live, learn and play.We believe in supporting each child’s whole health—the social, economic, behavioral and environmental factors that also affect their lives. As one of the largest pediatric health systems in the country, the expertise of our multi-state, multi-site system is available wherever we care for kids—and our Nemours KidsHealth.org website is the #1 most-trusted source for physician-reviewed information and advice on children's health and parenting. We aim to create the healthiest generations of children \nby envisioning a future where all children have access to the highest standard of care regardless of who they are or where they live.\n\nNote: Nemours YouTube channel offers general information and not specific or personalized medical advice. Patients and their families should contact their healthcare providers for medical advice specific to their situations.","concerns@nemours.org; nemhimreferralteam@nemours.org; patientrecords@nemours.org; patientrelationsDV@nemours.org; PR@nemours.org","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnFa87EMSmu3FwTWf_urLig","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnFa87EMSmu3FwTWf_urLig","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:02.779Z"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnFa87EMSmu3FwTWf_urLig","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:02.779Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnFa87EMSmu3FwTWf_urLig","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":32000,"raw":"32K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnFa87EMSmu3FwTWf_urLig","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:02.779Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"concerns@nemours.org","purpose":"unknown","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"channel_published","sourceUrls":["https://www.ne